  "title": "Revenue-cycle control walkthrough",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Revenue-cycle control walkthrough</h2><p>Evaluate the design and evidence of controls in an order-to-cash cycle.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs2-f1\">Concern in customer and credit approval</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs2-f1\"><option value=\"Incompatible authorization responsibilities\">Incompatible authorization responsibilities</option><option value=\"A complete independent credit review\">A complete independent credit review</option><option value=\"Only a presentation issue\">Only a presentation issue</option><option value=\"No control risk\">No control risk</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs2-f2\">Concern in production program access</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs2-f2\"><option value=\"Unauthorized change risk\">Unauthorized change risk</option><option value=\"Guaranteed operating effectiveness\">Guaranteed operating effectiveness</option><option value=\"A physical inventory issue only\">A physical inventory issue only</option><option value=\"A sufficient compensating control\">A sufficient compensating control</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs2-f3\">What the Type 1 report does not establish</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs2-f3\"><option value=\"Operating effectiveness over the period\">Operating effectiveness over the period</option><option value=\"The report’s date\">The report’s date</option><option value=\"The report’s stated scope\">The report’s stated scope</option><option value=\"The system description included\">The system description included</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs2-f4\">Additional evidence for planned reliance</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs2-f4\"><option value=\"Appropriate tests of operating effectiveness\">Appropriate tests of operating effectiveness</option><option value=\"Only the original inquiry\">Only the original inquiry</option><option value=\"A client waiver\">A client waiver</option><option value=\"No work after one successful match\">No work after one successful match</option></select></div></section>",
